     ["PYQ book (last 10+ years)", "Chapter-wise previous-year questions, any standard publisher", "Your map of what the exam actually asks"],
     ["Physics numericals", "One standard objective series (the DC Pandey / Cengage class of books)", "Volume practice for the numerical core"],
